; unary transforms / extractors: abs, sin, cos, sqrt, length, exists, etc.
; these ARE morphisms: structure-preserving maps from one space to another.
; pure: no state, no side effects. same input → same output.

(kosha op-class-projection
  (swarupa yantra shuddhi)
  (ahara eka)
  (phala siddha)
  (abheda morphism))
